{"header": "<header class=\"site\" id=\"hdr\">\n  <div class=\"wrap bar\">\n    <div class=\"pill\"><a class=\"logo\" href=\"#top\"><i aria-hidden=\"true\"></i>Alfonzo Louw</a></div>\n    <nav class=\"pill\" aria-label=\"Main\">\n      <ul>\n        <li><a href=\"#work\">Work</a></li>\n        <li><a href=\"#about\">About</a></li>\n        <li hidden id=\"navLI\"><a class=\"icon\" id=\"navLIa\" href=\"\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\" aria-label=\"LinkedIn (opens in a new tab)\"><svg width=\"18\" height=\"18\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><path fill=\"currentColor\" d=\"M4.98 3.5a2.5 2.5 0 11-.01 5 2.5 2.5 0 01.01-5zM3 9h4v12H3zM9 9h3.8v1.7h.05c.53-1 1.83-2.05 3.77-2.05C20.6 8.65 21 11.2 21 14.4V21h-4v-5.8c0-1.4-.03-3.2-1.95-3.2-1.95 0-2.25 1.5-2.25 3.1V21H9z\"/></svg></a></li>\n        <li><a class=\"cta\" href=\"#contact\">Get in touch</a></li>\n      </ul>\n    </nav>\n  </div>\n</header>", "home": "<div class=\"hero\" id=\"top\" data-dark>\n  <div class=\"backdrop\" aria-hidden=\"true\"></div>\n\n  <div class=\"intro\">\n    <h1>Senior product designer turning complex problems into simple experiences</h1>\n    <a class=\"go go-m\" href=\"#work\"><span aria-hidden=\"true\"><svg width=\"18\" height=\"18\" viewBox=\"0 0 18 18\"><path d=\"M3 9h11M10 4.5L14.5 9 10 13.5\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\"/></svg></span>See my work</a>\n\n  </div>\n  <div class=\"thoughts\" id=\"thoughts\" aria-hidden=\"true\"></div>\n  <div class=\"mcur\" id=\"mcur\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><svg width=\"22\" height=\"22\" viewBox=\"0 0 22 22\"><path d=\"M3 2.5l15 6.6-6.4 1.9-2.6 6.5z\" fill=\"#F1E9DC\" stroke=\"#1E1114\" stroke-width=\"1.4\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\"/></svg><span>Alfonzo</span></div>\n  <div class=\"figure\">\n    <p class=\"name\" aria-hidden=\"true\">Alfonzo</p>\n    <div class=\"subject\" id=\"subject\">\n      <img src=\"{{CUT}}\" alt=\"Portrait of Alfonzo Louw in a tan corduroy cap and gold glasses\" id=\"subjectImg\" width=\"1125\" height=\"1352\">\n      <canvas id=\"gl\" aria-hidden=\"true\"></canvas>\n      <div class=\"selframe\" id=\"selframe\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><a class=\"sel-label\" href=\"#/case/momo-p2p\" tabindex=\"-1\">Currently designing MTN MoMo</a><b class=\"h1\"></b><b class=\"h2\"></b><b class=\"h3\"></b><b class=\"h4\"></b><b class=\"h5\"></b><b class=\"h6\"></b><b class=\"h7\"></b><b class=\"h8\"></b><span class=\"sel-dim\" id=\"seldim\"></span></div>\n\n    </div>\n    <p class=\"name outline\" aria-hidden=\"true\">Alfonzo</p>\n    <button type=\"button\" class=\"hpause\" id=\"hpause\" aria-label=\"Pause animation\"><svg width=\"12\" height=\"12\" viewBox=\"0 0 16 16\" aria-hidden=\"true\" id=\"hpIcon\"><rect x=\"3\" y=\"2\" width=\"3.5\" height=\"12\" rx=\"1\" fill=\"currentColor\"/><rect x=\"9.5\" y=\"2\" width=\"3.5\" height=\"12\" rx=\"1\" fill=\"currentColor\"/></svg></button>\n  </div>\n  <div class=\"aside\">\n    <p>I research, design, animate and build digital products that solve real problems for people and businesses.</p>\n    <a class=\"go\" href=\"#work\"><span aria-hidden=\"true\"><svg width=\"18\" height=\"18\" viewBox=\"0 0 18 18\"><path d=\"M3 9h11M10 4.5L14.5 9 10 13.5\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\"/></svg></span>See my work</a>\n  </div>\n\n</div>\n\n  <div class=\"caps\">\n    <div class=\"wrap\">\n      <ul>\n        <li><b>Product strategy</b><span>Defining the right problems to solve</span></li>\n        <li><b>Product design</b><span>Turning complexity into simple experiences</span></li>\n        <li><b>UX/UI design</b><span>Creating intuitive, purposeful interfaces</span></li>\n        <li><b>Design systems</b><span>Building scalable patterns that keep products consistent</span></li>\n      </ul>\n    </div>\n  </div>\n\n  <section id=\"work\">\n    <div class=\"wrap\">\n      <div class=\"sh\">\n        <h2>Selected work</h2>\n        <p>Payments, compliance and everyday money tasks for banks and mobile money across Africa.</p>\n      </div>\n      <ul class=\"rows\" id=\"rows\"></ul>\n      <h3 class=\"more-h\">More work</h3>\n      <ul class=\"grid\" id=\"grid\"></ul>\n    </div>\n  </section>\n\n  <section id=\"about\">\n    <div class=\"wrap\">\n      <div class=\"sh\"><h2>About</h2></div>\n      <div class=\"about\">\n        <div class=\"bio\">\n          <p>I started in broadcast animation, moved through CX and consulting, and now design financial products as a Senior Product Designer at Human Insights.</p>\n          <p>That mix means I think about the business case, the user's context and the build at the same time. I'm based in Johannesburg and work with teams across Africa.</p>\n        </div>\n        <div>\n          <ol class=\"timeline\">\n            <li><b>Human Insights</b><span>2026 to now</span><em>Senior Product Designer</em></li>\n            <li><b>Warp</b><span>2025 to 2026</span><em>Product Designer</em></li>\n            <li><b>FNB</b><span>Until 2025</span><em>Senior Product Designer</em></li>\n          </ol>\n          <div class=\"skills\"><span>Product strategy</span><span>UX research</span><span>Interaction design</span><span>Motion</span><span>Design systems</span><span>React / Next.js</span><span>TypeScript</span><span>Framer Motion</span></div>\n        </div>\n      </div>\n    </div>\n  </section>\n\n  <section id=\"words\" aria-labelledby=\"words-h\">\n    <div class=\"wrap\">\n      <div class=\"sh\"><h2 id=\"words-h\">Kind words</h2></div>\n      <div class=\"quotes\">\n        <figure><blockquote>Alfonzo takes great pride in his work, consistently delivering high-quality results with exceptional attention to detail.</blockquote><figcaption><b>Richard Welcome</b>Freelance client</figcaption></figure>\n        <figure><blockquote>He brings a blend of humour, inspiration and a strong work ethic, firmly believing that hard work builds character.</blockquote><figcaption><b>Stacey Thomas</b>Lead Graphic Designer</figcaption></figure>\n        <figure><blockquote>Working with Alfonzo was a game-changer. His attention to detail and design thinking truly elevated our product.</blockquote><figcaption><b>Sarah M.</b>Product Manager</figcaption></figure>\n        <figure><blockquote>Alfonzo\u2019s work on our mobile app UI was top-notch. Super clean, intuitive and well thought out.</blockquote><figcaption><b>James L.</b>Startup Founder</figcaption></figure>\n        <figure><blockquote>He nailed our dashboard redesign. Our users love the new experience and we\u2019ve seen a huge bump in engagement.</blockquote><figcaption><b>Linda R.</b>UX Lead</figcaption></figure>\n      </div>\n    </div>\n  </section>\n\n  <div class=\"contact\" id=\"contact\" data-dark>\n    <h2>Let's build something.</h2>\n    <p>Hiring for a senior product role, or have a product that needs design and build? Email is the fastest way to reach me.</p>\n    <div class=\"row-c\">\n      <a class=\"go\" href=\"mailto:alfonzolouw9@gmail.com\"><span aria-hidden=\"true\"><svg width=\"18\" height=\"18\" viewBox=\"0 0 18 18\"><path d=\"M3 9h11M10 4.5L14.5 9 10 13.5\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\"/></svg></span>alfonzolouw9@gmail.com</a>\n      <button class=\"btn-o\" type=\"button\" id=\"copy\">Copy email</button>\n    </div>\n    <div class=\"alt\">\n      <a href=\"\" id=\"lnkLinkedIn\" hidden>LinkedIn</a>\n      <a href=\"\" id=\"lnkCV\" hidden>Download CV</a>\n    </div>\n  </div>\n", "footer": "<footer><div class=\"wrap\"><span>\u00a9 2026 Alfonzo Louw</span><span>Designed &amp; Developed by Alfonzo</span></div></footer>", "dialog": "<dialog class=\"lb\" id=\"lb\" aria-label=\"Enlarged image\">\n  <button type=\"button\" class=\"x\" aria-label=\"Close\"><svg width=\"18\" height=\"18\" viewBox=\"0 0 18 18\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><path d=\"M4 4l10 10M14 4L4 14\"